@startuml
title UC-001 Seek Travel Advice - Module Interaction
autonumber
actor Customer
participant "MOD-CI\nCustomer Interaction" as CI
participant "MOD-CM\nCustomer Management" as CM
participant "MOD-TPM\nTravel Product Management" as TPM

Customer -> CI: seekTravelAdvice(goals, preferences)
CI -> CM: getCustomerContext(customerReference)
CM --> CI: confirmedContext
CI -> TPM: findTravelOptions(confirmedContext)
TPM --> CI: suitableOptions
CI --> Customer: advice and resumable context
@enduml
